      "Text": "Security update for zbar",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for zbar fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-88371: undefined behavior via the Code 128 `decode6()` function (bsc#1282825).\n- CVE-2026-95516: 1-byte heap buffer overflow write in Structured-Append QR text extraction (bsc#1282391).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
